          - Battery Temp      -> battery_temp_c  != null ? … : '—'  (thermometer.medium green→statusSuccess).
          - HV Isolation      -> isolationResistance != null && > 0 ? `${fmtNumber} kΩ` : '—' (shield.fill;
                                 4-band ladder null/≤0→muted, ≥500→green, ≥100→amber, else red).
